      "data": {
        "text": "**Initiating OAuth Login**\n\nI'm now diving into the \"Same-scenario scored files\" and starting with `start_oauth_login.py`. This script is crucial as it's the gateway, setting up the OAuth/OIDC flow via AWS Cognito. My focus is on constructing the authorization URL, the initial step in the process.\n\n\n",
