      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining the Callback Handler**\n\nI'm now focusing on `oauth_callback.py`, the pivotal file for managing the Cognito callback. It will be responsible for meticulously exchanging the authorization code obtained from Cognito for the necessary tokens, which is an interesting piece of logic, so I am interested in designing the file correctly.\n\n\n",
