      "data": {
        "text": "**Implementing PKCE Login**\n\nI'm now diving into `pkce_login.py`. My primary focus is implementing a PKCE login flow specifically tailored for public clients leveraging AWS Cognito. I'm starting by addressing the core mechanics: generating the `code_verifier` and its corresponding `code_challenge`. The design will ensure robustness within this specific context.\n\n\n",
